OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Austen leaves 2,000 homes
OL,4,Awithout power in Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of homes have been left
OL,7,Fwithout power as Storm Austen hits
OL,8,FWales.
OL,10,FThe biggest outage is in Cardigan,
OL,11,Fwhere more than 500 homes have been
OL,12,Faffected, National Grid has reported.
OL,14,FThe Met Office had warned Austen, the
OL,15,Ffirst named storm of the autumn, would
OL,16,Fbring strong winds up to 70mph
OL,17,F(112km/h) overnight on Thursday and
OL,18,Finto Friday, mainly in coastal areas.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
