OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Austen leaves 2,000 homes
OL,4,Awithout power in Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo yellow warnings for Wales are in
OL,7,Fplace on Friday, with periods of heavy
OL,8,Frain expected. The Met Office said
OL,9,Finjuries and danger to life from flying
OL,10,Fdebris were possible and advised
OL,11,Fdrivers and those using public
OL,12,Ftransport to plan ahead.
